        | 3   | hot         | none     | none  | calm   | flat           | thunderstorm |
        | 4   | hot         | light    | heavy | calm   | dangerous      | overcast     |
        | 5   | hot         | heavy    | light | breezy | surfable       | clear        |
        | 6   | cold        | none     | heavy | calm   | no marine data | overcast     |
        | 7   | hot         | none     | none  | gale   | no marine data | clear        |
      When the user requests activity rankings for "Biarritz"
      Then the response satisfies the activity ranking contract
